The organisation knows its assets that need protection: the business processes, the information, the information systems, the devices, the suppliers, and the development projects. Each asset has an owner and a classification.

== How to decide if this control is required

This control is required when the organisation runs an ISMS, or when NIS2 applies. A team that only needs the central controls for its products manages the components of each product in its development project.

== How to implement

Document the asset management process. Record the assets in the asset register of this home, and review the register at least once a year.

